Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.80,H_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu pikir bisa lari dariku?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.80,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.40,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kamu pikir bisa kabur dariku?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:04.17,S_id,,0,0,0,,Saranku: jangan coba-coba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:11.22,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bos, ampuni aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:13.02,S_id,,0,0,0,,soal pukul-memukul aku cuma anak buah kecil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.42,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bondol yang menyuruh semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.83,S_id,,0,0,0,,semalam kami bahkan pergi ke pemakaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:17.77,S_id,,0,0,0,,dan menginap semalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:18.83,S_id,,0,0,0,,Semua perintahmu kulakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_id,,0,0,0,,Lihat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.92,S_id,,0,0,0,,luka-lukaku belum sembuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:25.92,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku mohon, ampuni aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.72,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bangun. Ada yang mau kutanyakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.63,S_id,,0,0,0,,Suruh dia menunggu di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.82,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tunggu aku di depan ya, sayang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.13,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bos, aku cuma menjalankan perintah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.07,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.45,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tenang, cuma beberapa pertanyaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:41.78,S_id,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih, bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:43.62,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bondol sudah mati, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.80,S_id,,0,0,0,,Ka-kamu tahu?!
